{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>IU和邊佑錫主演的《21世紀大君夫人》日前播出完結篇，然而卻遭觀眾質疑劇情涉嫌矮化國格、扭曲歷史，要求演員們集體道歉。雖然《21世紀大君夫人》</p><p>邊佑錫以親筆信表示：「在週末期間，我一直十分擔心並顧慮自己的話是否會造成其他的傷害。在此，我懷著沈重的心情，向因這部作品而感到不便與擔憂的朋友們致以深深的歉意。」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133083584723161088306917.jpeg/yQRMvVOw4AAT5tDmXdDnVlg5yippISmlPBwCKjwcAio\" alt=\"邊佑錫以親筆信道歉（Instagram@byeonwooseok）\"><figcaption>邊佑錫以親筆信道歉（Instagram@byeonwooseok）</figcaption></figure><p>更多邊佑錫的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148281471471616463791.png/_3AwoHiAbcwO-chVfQqFzskeDO2pm8RkJXhN9iV4TfY\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148279399354368756482.png/mmxyPzK05ibj-vhhK8jbVIEjTEP-VqvFVKoVWVSqFVk\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148279323856896163875.png/j3xFoU-rS_BpVNPeKWvMbEoi2YEsm5xkslspELJbKRA\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148281349836800841920.png/2Q-CwvnO1vjiZ6PkaVBppEOIWRb6dOq-9qXi_Pal4vw\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148274471178240801253.png/vHPQR_0x5lnnN4OxBzhHug2YKAAgnBuWQF7MP0BezD8\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148277042024448861754.png/y7RSBn_2jXERiYZQVsIOj6uz1Yj7Dk9XrQ5Tp60OU6c\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148276681576448935780.png/CM360ZD3jZsziU30AuEU3fkv2patRL4c-rm51Pq5udQ\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148274823106560017342.png/gsbIPJaTSJ2ZxiYXXRvj05NJErnLkyCO8_a_7PP2v-w\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148274999267328628349.png/0a3hyvbgZEM5DtIlDP1zNGB0Az52lL_xJMQHzyTEB88\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148277385957376916348.png/n0BTdzydVV1bjV3J3RZKx6RCXLSaYp1UQ-ODwkPjg8I\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148274420715520197450.png/4zle6sX1V6t2yekw0-zXFCpFBUqG0fgzOtifOzrYnzs\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148272226963456267153.png/U5-qCW38D7SfEvjwflA-PGIupINc68lc5Sl6JeUpeiU\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148270037405696296874.png/emwuRR5SznbYbDRmBcypBbX_Q-E1QDfyC8Xn6gvF5-o\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148272130625536653048.png/R19PAgvatffp2SyFGVTfipthW1oGQrpq8u9DdfLvQ3U\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148272805515264306972.png/IzGoa4uEp33EnxdJiOdNZi4-4V43KF3OlMJxBZTCcQU\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148267696852992260314.png/glVI1fTm1V6CGxMIh5MFnCxVXlGzhdSIyvGhQcrxoUE\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148269953650688175243.png/KKe1ekfmu79pduPwSHw2EeAMhd7M4QEKNbv7XjW7-14\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148267210444800231754.png/QzowbcG00SZjkPgLBxWsSQ8eF8QHFrh6r2qPPK9qjzw\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148264790200320382957.png/pJN7zfjm_UOSh_M0YPh8ALArU-BsCUj80QZEJtEGRCY\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148246188593152756932.png/RvETD0VpL3531ELhp5Lq_YIS9JlJrnWWUoQo-1KEKPs\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148248726278144047138.png/kulM3Ko20YSXckrZt3X4BGoHjBvgywnfJSN7dSUje3U\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240717/890148243793514496570168.png/GyFovz_R-vWHm-FZHj0xVTiHjttY_fCenHKZ4pxymeI\" alt=\"邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)\"><figcaption>邊佑錫（IG@byeonwooseok)</figcaption></figure><p>邊佑錫說：「在作品拍攝和演出的過程中，對於作品中所蘊含的歷史背景與意義，以及這些內容會如何被觀眾朋友們所接受，我的思考確實有所欠缺。通過觀眾朋友們的意見，我進行了深刻的反省與自查。這也讓我再次銘記，作為一名演員，不僅要專注演技，更需要帶著責任感去審視和思考作品所傳達的信息與背景。在此向大家致以最誠摯的歉意。」</p><p>邊佑錫承諾：</p><p>IU也說：「我仔細閱讀了這幾天觀眾們留下的每一句話，作為作品的主演，沒能展現有責任感的樣子，讓各位如此失望，我深感抱歉，心情非常沈重。」</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133083962793529344452706.jpeg/VlULAR8Fm5qS4W1gB14F-oRrSf3iy749fJ22a3ydtms\" alt=\"iu也除了在生日會道歉，也在社交平台發文道歉。（Instagram@dlwlrma）\"><figcaption>iu也除了在生日會道歉，也在社交平台發文道歉。（Instagram@dlwlrma）</figcaption></figure><p>IU提到，對於大家指出的電視劇中各種歷史考證問題，「沒有經過深思熟慮就演出，對此我毫無猶豫地反省和道歉」。IU說明，這部作品以傳統歷史為基礎，展現想像力和大韓民國的傳統之美，是非常重要的作品：</p><p>粉絲看完心疼不已，紛紛留言為演員抱屈，不懂已經展現專業演技，為何還要背鍋道歉。而且《21世紀大君夫人》原本就是架空歷史故事，觀眾過於認真，導致全劇在遺憾中謝幕。</p><p>延伸閱讀：21世紀大君夫人｜IU、邊佑錫等主演拒絕受訪　網痛批：賺完錢就跑</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130561870248546304065942.jpeg/38WDXWjcyfJ-MRPTVX-Fx2aLYayCrfyJiby01Im8tNQ\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：21世紀大君夫人｜IU、邊佑錫等主演拒絕受訪　網痛批：賺完錢就跑】《21世紀大君夫人》收視成績佳，近期爆6名主要演員都婉拒「下檔訪問」，韓網批評「毫無責任感」。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：21世紀大君夫人｜IU、邊佑錫等主演拒絕受訪　網痛批：賺完錢就跑】《21世紀大君夫人》收視成績佳，近期爆6名主要演員都婉拒「下檔訪問」，韓網批評「毫無責任感」。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130561872589099008495102.jpeg/WozapvKA-qIMwax4-kA7U-UITtN6P6q4L_2IOC_9iDg\" alt=\"IU邊佑錫深情對戲。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>IU邊佑錫深情對戲。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120807344914173952589246.png/hcsi-RJOm82_As6JQmGXaojK72-x8Gg-6KKoxuiiqMY\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130561869950750720605397.jpeg/gvneFt8BW0_bPgJjjb6aUIFzOZYpF545pO8Kb6TvCm8\" alt=\"IU邊佑錫攜手度過難關。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>IU邊佑錫攜手度過難關。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131268261699522560168235.jpeg/tnF3Rqn7BNmk_q9RbdAD7hFV-6RF0NbtY_PckWPz3JE\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131268259312832512467015.jpeg/ebbNGDoPJk9JWitr54IDd9JyEzOtUw4klK0aw5StGsM\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131268256787730432129874.jpeg/bygEgTxHH-KegRjAcLxGAKBpzVS0gnMuoqS5Q6KkuUM\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260422/1123671125436403712273680.jpeg/AotoR7RijQybdIInvZTc0SqTNvfPAQN8K_JSCivyUgo\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130560634241421312310987.jpeg/8-pCOCTGBNcv4T9qJ_NggcMMCsvNRLJfBAa9qAQGvag\" alt=\"IU在劇中忍痛向邊佑錫提出離婚。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>IU在劇中忍痛向邊佑錫提出離婚。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251114/1066059348179947520706381.jpeg/seM72RqdlZLHKhXHui8WAqV7yqPlaBEoekvrRHpL60Q\" alt=\"《21世紀大君夫人》由IU主演。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>《21世紀大君夫人》由IU主演。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260513/1131268254447177728680741.jpeg/yysa-AAJ215ml4sqbP4Nmu8eBohvWvpuNDtjsjQ7Y7I\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120805924164866048096523.jpeg/1gb3v-23svNPrLhqIoGznf2gs4g7nCPlCvdKOAr3Sjg\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120807338052161536697145.jpeg/gBrpl04ekOsHDxwddZd0WrttukYIp-1XCLeeqAi3nqg\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120805537361956864017849.png/FA7LCzV-cM-r0QmTDrhyloQ2f-KkLLwKGfW-uBn1vrg\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260414/1120806567931940864728496.jpeg/2C9XkuOyab3b0IU6nCHjN6tUEx1FutRvXMsvoFzLL6A\" alt=\"（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260511/1130561868025434112719460.jpeg/FDZYLdH4QejM2NsMHAG0hJMU21Xfgq3BCTUOtQk1DrU\" alt=\"《21世紀大君夫人》火場戲創下高收視率。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）\"><figcaption>《21世紀大君夫人》火場戲創下高收視率。（《21世紀大君夫人》劇照）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閱讀：</p><p>被問到離婚財產怎麼分 白家綺自曝過來人經驗</p><p>噓編娛論／電視台最壞時代來了！B2揭「宇宙啦啦隊」9000萬回本內幕</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-18T10:12:14.917385+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1631,"images":40,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}